+++ b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-replace-in-place/design.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+## Context
+
+`replace` currently calls `get` (existence check), then `add(remove(...))`.
+
+## Decisions
+
+Keep the `get` existence check, then assign directly on the parent found by `parentOf`: `parent[index] = value` for arrays, `setMember` for objects. This keeps every error path identical and preserves member order.
diff --git a/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-replace-in-place/proposal.md b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-replace-in-place/proposal.md
